  "notes": "USAGE:\nA compound verb from ⟦{飼|か}う→飼う：08151_kau⟧ (to keep/raise an animal) + ⟦{慣|な}らす→慣らす：02390_narasu⟧ (to accustom). The passive form {飼|か}い{慣|な}らされた is commonly used as a modifier meaning \"tamed\" or \"domesticated.\"\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{動物|どうぶつ}→動物：01480_doubutsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{飼|か}い{慣|な}らす (to tame an animal)\n- {飼|か}い{慣|な}らされた⟦{鳥|とり}→鳥：00679_tori⟧ (a tamed bird)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {手懐|てなず}ける: to tame — emphasizes winning over trust through gentleness\n- {家畜化|かちくか}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to domesticate — more scientific/formal term",
